    "chunk_text": "Developed by Generation ALPHA in collaboration with TiE Colombo, the initiative responds to a growing need for young people to navigate an increasingly complex landscape shaped by technological disruption, evolving career pathways, and expanded access to opportunity. While students spend years preparing for examinations, few opportunities exist to help them understand themselves, explore what is possible, and build a practical framework for the future.\n\nA distinguishing feature of the program is unparalleled, direct access to the visionary entrepreneurs, enterprise executives, and venture investors driving Sri Lanka\u2019s economic future. Drawing from TiE Colombo\u2019s elite network of charter members, students will gain firsthand exposure to leadership and breakthrough innovation across diverse industries.\n\nThe program features immersive engagement with global technology pioneers like 99x, IFS, and the hSenid Group; strategic financial and corporate advisors from Deloitte and Stax; and market leaders shaping the modern landscape of lifestyle, hospitality, and sustainable infrastructure, including Vella, Velona, Hameedia, Rockland, and Vidullanka. Crucially, participants will interface directly with the architects of the island\u2019s capital markets and startup ecosystem, including venture capital and investment banking pioneers BOV Capital, nVentures, and Investrust Capital, alongside banking and non-banking financial heavyweights like Alliance Finance. This powerhouse network ensures participants graduate with a rare, 360-degree understanding of global market dynamics and the actionable entrepreneurial mindset required to lead in a rapidly evolving world."
