    "description": "UN subcommittee on prevention of torture concludes second visit to Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/UN-subcommittee-on-prevention-of-torture-concludes-second-visit-to-Sri-Lanka/108-344349",
