    "description": "ADB approves US$200Mn for Sri Lanka\u2019s Cyclone Ditwah recovery",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/ADB-approves-US-200Mn-for-Sri-Lankas-Cyclone-Ditwah-recovery/108-344353",
    "lang": "en",
